// P3G.1 (external-references.md ER1, ER2.1, ER6.4, ER6.5, ER6.7, ER6.18, ER X5, ER X6; DV1.1,
// DV1.7, DV1.8, DV1.11, DV2.1–DV2.3): inserting a part from another document at a version, on
// the linked-documents block (`cadrs_core::samples::linked_block`): document A "Block source"
// (Part Studio "Block", 50 × 30 × 25 = 37 500 mm³, version V1, in the library folder "Linked
// parts"), and document B "Block consumer" with an empty "Assembly 1".
// 01 B's Assembly 1, empty.
// 02 Insert (ex1-step4 A): Current document | Other documents | Standard content; the pointer on
//    Other documents.
// 03 Other documents (lesson-inserting-linked-documents.png): the filter button, "Search or paste
//    document id", and the locations My documents, Recently opened, Created by me and the folder
//    "Linked parts".
// 04 the folder: its documents, "Block source" with its thumbnail and newest version "V1", and
//    "Block copy" (no versions, greyed); the back row "‹ Linked parts".
// 05 (ER1.3, ex1-step4 B) A's id pasted into the search: only "Block source" is listed.
// 06 (ER1.6, ex1-step4 C) Block source opened: its name and "↳ V1" under it, the back arrow, the
//    Create version and Version graph buttons; Part Studios | Assemblies; the studio "Block" and
//    its part with thumbnails.
// 07 (ER1.7) the Version graph: Workspace / Version legend, Main (greyed: another document is
//    linked at a version), V1 (selected), Start.
// 08 (ER1.8) V1 picked again, the part picked up and following the pointer in the graphics area.
// 09 placed: "Inserted: 1".
// 10 (ER1.9, ER6.5, `ex1-step5.png`) accepted: "Part 1 <1>" with the version (link) icon in a
//    column at the right end of its row; its tooltip "Linked document: Block source › Block (V1)".
// 11 (ER6.18, ER X6) its mass properties: 37 500 mm³ (50 · 30 · 25), Aluminum 6061: 0.101 kg,
//    centre of mass (25, 15, 12.5) where it was placed.
// 11b (ER2.3) A edited in its own document (Extrude 1 25 → 40) and V2 made there
//    (`linked-block edit`): Part 1 <1> gets the blue update badge, its tooltip "V2 is available";
//    the tab Assembly 1 its badge too.
// 12 (ER2.1, DV1.11) B unchanged: the instance still 37 500 mm³.
// 13 Insert → Other documents → Block source again: the newest version is now "↳ V2".
// 14 V2's part placed beside the V1 instance and accepted: "Part 1 <2>" (numbered with the V1
//    instance), 60 000 mm³ (50 · 30 · 40), the V1 instance still 25 high.
// 15 (ER X5, ER6.7) Ctrl+C / Ctrl+V with both instances selected: "Part 1 <3>" (V1) and
//    "Part 1 <4>" (V2) keep their links; the tooltip of <4> names V2.
// 15b (ER6.7) the linked instance's menu: Update linked document… (hovered), Open linked
//    document (enabled since P3G.4) and Pin reference.
// 16 (DV1.8, ER1.5) Insert → Other documents → Linked parts → Block copy: "No versions", the
//    message and its Create version button.
// 17 Create version: the "Create version from Main" dialog (Name V1, Description, Create,
//    Create version and edit properties, Cancel).
// 18 Created: Block copy opens at its new "↳ V1" with its studio listed. Cancelled (nothing
//    inserted).
// 18a B versioned from the top bar (Create version → Create): the versions counter goes 0 → 1
//    (the pointer on it).
// 18b (DV1.5) "Cycle partner" (whose assembly Top holds B's Assembly 1 at that version) opened
//    in Other documents → Assemblies.
// 18c Top picked and clicked into the view: refused, the red error toast "Circular reference:
//    Block consumer › Assembly 1 → Cycle partner › Top → Block consumer"; nothing inserted.
// 19 (DV1.7, ER1.10) A moved to the trash (`linked-block trash`): the link icons turn red, the
//    tooltip "Cannot open a document in the trash. Restore the document from Trash."; the
//    geometry stays.
// 20 A deleted for good (`linked-block purge`): "Resource does not exist"; the four instances
//    still 2 · 37 500 + 2 · 60 000 = 195 000 mm³ (the whole assembly's mass properties).
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(20),
        Custom("linked-block"),
        Wait(60),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-block-consumer-assembly"),
        Click(ui("insert")),
        WaitFor("insert-dialog"),
        Wait(5),
        Hover(ui("insert-source-1")),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("02-insert-other-documents-tab"),
        Click(ui("insert-source-1")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-loc-mine"),
        Wait(5),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-other-documents-locations"),
        WaitFor("insert-other-loc-folder-linked-parts"),
        Click(ui("insert-other-loc-folder-linked-parts")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-doc-block-source"),
        Wait(10),
        Hover(ui("insert-other-doc-block-source")),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-folder-documents"),
        Click(ui("insert-other-search-field")),
        Wait(3),
        Type("3a610000-0000-0000-0000-000000000100"),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("05-pasted-id"),
        Click(ui("insert-other-doc-block-source")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-header"),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-block-source-at-v1"),
        Click(ui("insert-other-graph")),
        WaitFor("insert-graph"),
        Wait(5),
        Hover(ui("insert-graph-node-1")),
        Wait(3),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-version-graph"),
        Click(ui("insert-graph-node-1")),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("insert-part-part-1")),
        Wait(3),
        Hover(world(80, 40)),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("08-part-follows-pointer"),
        Click(world(80, 40)),
        Wait(10),
        Hover(ui("insert-count")),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-inserted-1"),
        Click(ui("insert-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(10),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(20),
        Hover(ui("instance-row-1-linked")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("10-linked-instance-icon"),
        Click(ui("instance-row-1")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("11-mass-37500"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        Wait(3),
        Custom("linked-block edit"),
        Wait(20),
        Hover(ui("instance-row-1-linked")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("11b-source-edited-badge"),
        // Part 1 <1> is still selected.
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("12-source-edited-still-37500"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("insert")),
        WaitFor("insert-dialog"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("insert-source-1")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-loc-mine"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("insert-other-loc-mine")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-doc-block-source"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("insert-other-doc-block-source")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-header"),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("13-newest-is-v2"),
        Click(ui("insert-part-part-1")),
        Wait(3),
        Hover(world(80, -60)),
        Wait(3),
        Click(world(80, -60)),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("insert-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(10),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(20),
        // A row click toggles it: <1> off, <2> on.
        Click(ui("instance-row-1")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("instance-row-2")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("14-v2-instance-60000"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        Wait(3),
        // A row click adds to the selection: with <2> still selected, <1> joins it.
        Click(ui("instance-row-1")),
        Wait(3),
        Key("Ctrl+C"),
        Wait(3),
        MoveTo(1100, 300),
        Wait(3),
        Key("Ctrl+V"),
        Wait(20),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(20),
        Hover(ui("instance-row-4-linked")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("15-pasted-keeps-link"),
        // ER6.7: the linked instance's menu: its P3G.2 / P3G.3 items, disabled with their tooltips.
        RightClick(ui("instance-row-1")),
        WaitFor("assembly-context-menu"),
        Wait(5),
        Hover(ui("asm-update-linked")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("15b-linked-instance-menu"),
        Key("Escape"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("insert")),
        WaitFor("insert-dialog"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("insert-source-1")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-loc-mine"),
        Wait(3),
        WaitFor("insert-other-loc-folder-linked-parts"),
        Click(ui("insert-other-loc-folder-linked-parts")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-doc-block-copy"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("insert-other-doc-block-copy")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-no-version"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("16-no-versions"),
        Click(ui("insert-other-no-version-create")),
        WaitFor("create-version-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("17-create-version-dialog"),
        Click(ui("create-version-create")),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("18-created-v1-opened"),
        Click(ui("insert-dialog-cancel")),
        Wait(10),
        // DV1.5: B gets a version; "Cycle partner" links B's Assembly 1 at it; inserting Cycle
        // partner's Top into B's Assembly 1 is refused.
        Click(ui("document-create-version")),
        WaitFor("create-version-dialog"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("create-version-create")),
        Wait(10),
        Hover(ui("document-versions")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("18a-consumer-versioned"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
